{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/0e226a2f31f266343216cb24696b6b31.poster.avif?t=1751097990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/0e226a2f31f266343216cb24696b6b31.webm?t=1751097990\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a legendary story of receiving the &quot;Divine Calling.&quot; You will play as a small-town yoga teacher who starts off down-and-out but eventually gains fame and fortune. Along the way, you will meet various types of sexy beauties who become your students... the &quot;powerful career woman,&quot; the &quot;lonely hot mom,&quot; her &quot;rebellious daughter,&quot; and perhaps even the &quot;Goddess of Yoga?&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your business grows, you will uncover interesting small-town stories and face rivals who challenge you. How you subdue them... or completely defeat them is up to you. Now, with your professional and heartfelt &quot;guidance,&quot; let everyone understand the beauty of yoga, achieve the unity of heaven and man, and feel the great sexual energy! Abhyasa and Vairagya! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/867e056a8b58bc87e26cb3561c4fc94b.poster.avif?t=1751097990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/867e056a8b58bc87e26cb3561c4fc94b.mp4?t=1751097990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will have 60 game days to develop their yoga business, guide students, and get to know them more &quot;deeply.&quot; Through enthusiastic guidance during classes, sometimes &quot;sparks&quot; will fly, which is quite reasonable! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By guiding students to perform the correct poses, you collect class fees and increase intimacy with them. Ultimately, build your yoga empire in this happy small town! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/876c427ddad998e1f7abd8fe3078211b.avif?t=1751097990\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed using the rare Unreal Engine, with exquisite and beautiful character models and vivid animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not just clicking and reading the story, players can interact &quot;intimately&quot; with students through &quot;dragging&quot; and &quot;tapping&quot; during classes. Even if things get heated, don't forget the unity of heaven and man!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Effectively allocate resources, expand your yoga studio, or purchase various interactive props to unlock hidden stories for each character and explore their deepest desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A combination of story, gameplay, text, and beautiful models and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/cf57161e0912c592fd94e0176e445e39.poster.avif?t=1751097990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/cf57161e0912c592fd94e0176e445e39.mp4?t=1751097990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Translated By ChatGpt)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images